cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SciLitRAG in your research, software, or academic work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

title: "SciLitRAG"
abstract: >-
  SciLitRAG is a research-paper question-answering system built using
  retrieval-augmented generation. It combines hybrid retrieval, reciprocal
  rank fusion, cross-encoder reranking, adaptive context selection, and
  locally hosted large language model inference.

authors:
  - family-names: "Das"
    given-names: "Debjeet"

repository-code: "https://github.com/dasdebjeet/SciLitRAG"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - research paper retrieval
  - large language models
  - hybrid search
  - information retrieval
  - question answering
